00:46:04,410 --> 00:46:05,410
for the weekend?

1062
00:46:05,410 --> 00:46:11,890
Exactly. So today we will have a long and relaxed conversation about our weekends, hobbies,

1063
00:46:11,890 --> 00:46:13,490
and free time activities.

1064
00:46:13,490 --> 00:46:17,650
And we will use simple English so you can easily understand and practice with us.

1065
00:46:17,650 --> 00:46:21,330
Okay, Daniel, let's start with a simple question. How are you today?

1066
00:46:21,330 --> 00:46:24,170
I'm doing well, Emma. Thank you. I feel relaxed today.

1067
00:46:24,170 --> 00:46:26,730
