1068
00:46:26,730 --> 00:46:28,890
Because I had a very peaceful weekend.

1069
00:46:28,890 --> 00:46:32,410
That sounds nice. Tell me about your weekend. What did you do?

1070
00:46:32,410 --> 00:46:36,370
Well on Saturday morning I woke up a little later than usual.

1071
00:46:36,370 --> 00:46:37,730
What time did you wake up?

1072
00:46:37,730 --> 00:46:39,130
Around 8.30 in the morning.

1073
00:46:39,130 --> 00:46:42,330
That's not too late, but it's definitely later than a workday.

1074
00:46:42,330 --> 00:46:45,330
Yes, during the week I usually wake up at 6.30.

1075
00:46:45,330 --> 00:46:48,690
So waking up at 8.30 must feel like a luxury.

1076
00:46:48,690 --> 00:46:49,690
It really does.

1077
00:46:49,690 --> 00:46:53,490
I stayed in bed for a few extra minutes and then I made a cup of coffee.

1078
00:46:53,490 --> 00:46:55,770
Coffee is always a good start to the day.

1079
00:46:55,770 --> 00:46:56,930
I agree.

1080
00:46:56,930 --> 00:47:00,290
After that I sat near the window and enjoyed the quiet morning.

1081
00:47:00,290 --> 00:47:02,010
That sounds very peaceful.

1082
00:47:02,010 --> 00:47:03,690
Did you do anything else in the morning?

1083
00:47:03,690 --> 00:47:04,690
Yes.

1084
00:47:04,690 --> 00:47:07,010
After breakfast, I went for a walk around my neighborhood.

1085
00:47:07,010 --> 00:47:08,010
Was the weather nice?

1086
00:47:08,010 --> 00:47:09,010
Yes.

1087
00:47:09,010 --> 00:47:11,130
The weather was sunny and cool, perfect for walking.

1088
00:47:11,130 --> 00:47:12,130
That's wonderful.

1089
00:47:12,130 --> 00:47:14,250
I love walking when the weather is nice.

1090
00:47:14,250 --> 00:47:16,490
