1094
00:47:22,130 --> 00:47:24,250
On Saturday morning, I went to the grocery store.

1095
00:47:24,250 --> 00:47:26,570
Grocery shopping is a very normal weekend activity.

1096
00:47:26,570 --> 00:47:27,570
Yes.

1097
00:47:27,570 --> 00:47:29,250
I like to buy food for the whole week.

1098
00:47:29,250 --> 00:47:30,650
