1099
00:47:30,650 --> 00:47:31,650
Very crowded.

1100
00:47:31,650 --> 00:47:33,810
people were shopping at the same time.

1101
00:47:33,810 --> 00:47:35,610
That happens often on Saturday mornings.

1102
00:47:35,610 --> 00:47:37,930
Yes, but I finished quickly.

1103
00:47:37,930 --> 00:47:40,810
After that, I went home and started cooking lunch.

1104
00:47:40,810 --> 00:47:41,810
What did you cook?

1105
00:47:41,810 --> 00:47:44,770
I cooked rice, vegetables, and grilled chicken.

1106
00:47:44,770 --> 00:47:45,970
That sounds delicious.

1107
00:47:45,970 --> 00:47:47,930
It was simple, but very tasty.

1108
00:47:47,930 --> 00:47:49,850
I enjoy cooking on the weekend too.

1109
00:47:49,850 --> 00:47:52,170
Really, what do you usually cook?

1110
00:47:52,170 --> 00:47:54,130
Sometimes pasta, sometimes soup.

1111
00:47:54,130 --> 00:47:55,330
It depends on my mood.

1112
00:47:55,330 --> 00:47:58,970
Cooking at home is nice because you can relax and take your time.

1113
00:47:58,970 --> 00:47:59,970
Exactly.

1114
00:47:59,970 --> 00:48:05,250
week everything feels rushed. That's very true. After your lunch on Saturday what

1115
00:48:05,250 --> 00:48:09,330
did you do next? After lunch I cleaned one apartment. Cleaning is not the most

1116
00:48:09,330 --> 00:48:14,290
exciting activity. No, but it feels great when everything is clean. I agree. A

1117
