clean home feels peaceful. After cleaning I decided to watch a movie. What

1118
00:48:18,890 --> 00:48:22,570
movie did you watch? I watched a comedy movie. Comedy movies are great for

1119
00:48:22,570 --> 00:48:26,130
relaxing. Yes, I laughed a lot during the movie. That sounds like a nice

1120
00:48:26,130 --> 00:48:30,770
afternoon. What about your Saturday afternoon? In the afternoon, I met a friend for coffee.

1121
00:48:30,770 --> 00:48:35,090
That sounds fun. Where did you meet? We met at a small cafe near the park.

1122
00:48:35,090 --> 00:48:38,210
Was the cafe busy? A little busy, but we found a quiet table.

1123
00:48:38,210 --> 00:48:41,970
What did you and your friend talk about? We talked about work, travel plans,

1124
00:48:41,970 --> 00:48:45,890
and some funny stories from our week. Meeting friends is one of the best ways

1125
00:48:45,890 --> 00:48:49,410
to spend free time. I agree. Good conversation makes the day better.

1126
00:48:49,410 --> 00:48:53,330
How long did you stay at the cafe? About an hour. That's a nice amount of time.

1127
00:48:53,330 --> 00:48:56,130
Yes. After that, I went home and rested for a while.

1128
00:48:56,130 --> 00:48:57,650
