1161
00:50:06,770 --> 00:50:12,490
was beautiful and the air was very fresh. That sounds like a wonderful memory. It was.

1162
00:50:12,490 --> 00:50:17,650
What about you? Do you enjoy traveling? Yes, I do. I especially like visiting quiet

1163
00:50:17,650 --> 00:50:23,690
towns and nature parks. Nature can be very peaceful. Exactly. What did you do on Sunday

1164
