1165
00:50:29,130 --> 00:50:33,130
Not every week, but we try to meet when we can. What did you do together? We talked,

1166
00:50:33,130 --> 00:50:37,490
drank tea, and played a board game. Board games are fun. Yes, they're simple but

1167
00:50:37,490 --> 00:50:41,650
very entertaining. Who won the game? My sister won this time. Maybe next time you

1168
00:50:41,650 --> 00:50:45,770
will win. I hope so. After visiting your sister, what did you do? I went home

1169
00:50:45,770 --> 00:50:46,850
and prepared dinner.

1170
00:50:46,850 --> 00:50:47,850
What did you cook?

1171
00:50:47,850 --> 00:50:49,170
I cooked vegetable pasta.

1172
00:50:49,170 --> 00:50:50,170
That sounds tasty.

1173
00:50:50,170 --> 00:50:51,890
It was simple and quick to make.

1174
00:50:51,890 --> 00:50:55,250
Sunday evenings always feel a little different to me.

1175
00:50:55,250 --> 00:50:56,250
Why is that?

1176
00:50:56,250 --> 00:50:57,930
Because I start thinking about the new week.

1177
00:50:57,930 --> 00:51:00,090
I feel the same way sometimes.

1178
00:51:00,090 --> 00:51:02,770
Sunday night can feel calm but also a little serious.

1179
00:51:02,770 --> 00:51:05,450
Yes, it feels like the weekend is ending.

1180
00:51:05,450 --> 00:51:06,450
Exactly.

1181
00:51:06,450 --> 00:51:08,770
Do you usually prepare for the week on Sunday?

1182
00:51:08,770 --> 00:51:10,490
Yes, I try to plan my schedule.

1183
00:51:10,490 --> 00:51:11,610
That's a good habit.

1184
00:51:11,610 --> 00:51:14,690
I write a short list of things I need to do on Monday.

1185
00:51:14,690 --> 00:51:20,690
helps reduce stress. It really does. Sometimes I also prepare my clothes and lunch for Monday.

1186
00:51:20,690 --> 00:51:23,810
That's very organized. It makes Monday morning easier.

1187
00:51:23,810 --> 00:51:29,010
Monday mornings can be difficult sometimes. Yes, especially after a relaxing weekend.

1188
00:51:29,010 --> 00:51:33,090
But a good weekend gives us energy for the new week. That's a great point.

1189
00:51:33,090 --> 00:51:36,290
Free time is very important for our health and happiness.

1190
00:51:36,290 --> 00:51:41,570
I completely agree. People need time to rest, enjoy hobbies, and spend time with friends or

1191
00:51:41,570 --> 00:51:46,370
